# <type>: <subject> (Max 50 char)
# |<----  Using 50 characters is a good rule of thumb  ---->|
#
# Explain why this change is being made. Keep lines to 72 characters.
# |<----  Using 72 characters is a good rule of thumb  ---->|

# --- COMMIT TYPES ---
#feat:     A new feature
#fix:      A bug fix
#docs:     Documentation changes
#style:    Formatting, missing semi-colons, etc; no code change
#refactor: Refactoring production code (e.g. renaming variables)
#test:     Adding missing tests, refactoring tests; no production code change
#chore:    Updating build tasks, package manager configs, etc; no production code change
#
# --- EXAMPLE ---
# feat: add custom vibe slider matching react app
#
# Replace the default Material 3 slider with a custom gesture-based VibeSlider
# to match the design aesthetic and responsive tick coloring of the React app.
